cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "modelmap: Find, Map and Remove Local LLM Models"
abstract: >
  modelmap finds the large language model files stored on a machine, across
  the Hugging Face cache, Ollama, oMLX, LM Studio, llama.cpp and arbitrary
  directories. It identifies files by their headers, counts each shared file
  once, and draws the result as an area-proportional treemap.
